  "limits": [
    "Outer states represent the Pluto system barycenter, not the physical center. Available PLU060 offset coverage does not qualify the full accepted range or omitted physical-center velocity.",
    "Source representation bounds do not certify absolute DE441 observational accuracy. Native implementation comparisons are sampled except for all-record seam checks.",
    "Single-host release test-process timings and peak RSS are observations, not device performance or a resource ceiling. The preserved historical baseline includes cold legacy integration; the new engineRange workload has no baseline counterpart.",
    "The MajorBodies barycentric origin is retained. The complete PLU060 window and bounded interior tapers are qualified separately. Public position/state endpoint support includes the bounded Pluto-only Earth evaluation. Sun-dependent angles retain the Sun endpoint restriction; Search qualification remains separate."
  ],
